13979417/edb-import/verification.json"} {"question" "q-71934" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer-field/correct" "value" [:answer.type/text "$R$ and $S$ only"] "category" "ma_successful_grade" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/13979417/state.json" "file_sha256" "5c883a2e5de1eeebb6a3e52c4ea740ce8fa1bb3890e192b9895aff80945bcf13" "basis" 851 "verification" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/13979417/edb-import/verification.json"} {"question" "q-127903" "field" nil "attribute" "question/problem" "value" "If $M=[\\begin{aligned}t & 5 \\\\ t & 9\\end{aligned}]$ is a singular matrix, calculate the value(s) of $t.$" "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/13979417/state.json" "file_sha256" "5c883a2e5de1eeebb6a3e52c4ea740ce8fa1bb3890e192b9895aff80945bcf13" "basis" 851 "verification" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/13979417/edb-import/verification.json"} {"question" "q-127903" "field" nil "attribute" "question/worked-solution" "value" "The matrix $M$ is singular if and only if $det(M)=0.$ Calculating the determinant, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}det(M) & =t\\cdot 9-t\\cdot 5 \\\\  & =9t-5t \\\\  & =4t\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nNow, we set the determinant equal to $0$ and solve for $t:$\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}4t & =0 \\\\ t & =0\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, the value of $t$ is $t=0.$" "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/13979417/state.json" "file_sha256" "5c883a2e5de1eeebb6a3e52c4ea740ce8fa1bb3890e192b9895aff80945bcf13" "basis" 851 "verification" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/13979417/edb-import/verification.json"} {"question" "q-127903" "field" nil "attribute" "question/difficulty" "value" :question.difficulty/easy "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Dev